  "answer": "This is a known limitation, not a bug in your install. Quick Access can't be customized yet. You can't drag and drop utilities onto it or right-click to add them. PowerToys picks the utilities it shows on its own, which is probably how Text Extractor got there. The maintainers closed similar requests as duplicates of PowerToys#24283, \"Allow customization of the quick access icons\". Subscribe to that issue for updates. Until it ships, launch other utilities from the PowerToys Settings window or with their activation shortcuts."
